  "body": "Synapse supports a `DELETE  /directory/list/room/<room ID>` endpoint which appears to be unspecced. (It's specced with GET and PUT).\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/e24ff8ebe3d4119d377355402245947f7de61c00/synapse/rest/client/directory.py#L157-L166\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @DMRobertson in https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/13102#issuecomment-1163320590_\r\n\r\nDELETE is a shortcut for PUTting private visibility. I'd like to either spec it or remove it.",
